    {
      "id": 787214,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "A missing validation on the customer_bid field when creating rental trips allowed passengers to submit arbitrary bid amounts, including very low fares. While drivers would not have accepted such low-balled offers, the system displayed these manipulated fare trips without verification. Proper validation is now added to prevent unrealistic values.",
